{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42017","headline":"贻庐山清溪观王尊师 · 李中","name":"贻庐山清溪观王尊师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霞帔星冠复杖藜，积年修链住灵溪。\n松轩睡觉冷云起，石磴坐来春日西。\n采药每寻岩径远，弹琴常到月轮低。\n鼎中龙虎功成後，海上三山去不迷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42017.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42017","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}